{"3062700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rebel Roar", "steam_appid": 3062700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A PLANET TO LIBERATE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Rebel Roar is a deckbuilder where you must lead an animal revolution against the sinister world order imposed by the Sapiens, an invasive alien race that is on the verge of destroying your planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/eff184b73eb4231722116ad96a47318b.poster.avif?t=1787235860\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/eff184b73eb4231722116ad96a47318b.webm?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/eff184b73eb4231722116ad96a47318b.mp4?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">AN ACTION DECKBUILDER. CRUSH THE SAPIENS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build the perfect deck. Play with up to two characters simultaneously and battle against hordes of enemies: boxers, chefs, lawyers, household appliances, failed experiments, mutants, and other aberrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/0ecc903352a51d64c06c141cabedddde.poster.avif?t=1787235860\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/0ecc903352a51d64c06c141cabedddde.webm?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/0ecc903352a51d64c06c141cabedddde.mp4?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">EXPAND THE REBELLION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the planet Animalek, discover its regions and points of interest, and spread the rebellion as you bring the fight to every corner of your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/eeef851e2ce66599594e25d3fbfefe66.poster.avif?t=1787235860\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/eeef851e2ce66599594e25d3fbfefe66.webm?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/eeef851e2ce66599594e25d3fbfefe66.mp4?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">UNLOCK REBELS FOR THE RESISTANCE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Earn Liberation Packs and unlock a wide variety of rebel animals to fight against oppression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/1eb53762ba238ee6975756830685a3cd.poster.avif?t=1787235860\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/1eb53762ba238ee6975756830685a3cd.webm?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/1eb53762ba238ee6975756830685a3cd.mp4?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">SPECIALIZE YOUR REBELS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With every Class Package you earn, you'll discover new classes to assign to your rebels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/fd2fabdb2dc642258ea609389aecfb08.poster.avif?t=1787235860\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/fd2fabdb2dc642258ea609389aecfb08.webm?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/fd2fabdb2dc642258ea609389aecfb08.mp4?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">OVER 500 CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combine your animal cards with class cards and build the perfect deck. With over 500 cards and more than 10 decks to choose from, the possibilities for combos are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/cfe94eee76eb5ed90a76360b6c66aed8.poster.avif?t=1787235860\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/cfe94eee76eb5ed90a76360b6c66aed8.webm?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/cfe94eee76eb5ed90a76360b6c66aed8.mp4?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">HUGE CHARACTER ROSTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meet and play as 20 different rebels, each with their own story and unique special card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/e41005284bdfe84050889fa27fed8cce.poster.avif?t=1787235860\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/e41005284bdfe84050889fa27fed8cce.webm?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/e41005284bdfe84050889fa27fed8cce.mp4?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/6e4c779544990979fd9f2b890c8dd2b5.avif?t=1787235860\" width=1248 height=1261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A PLANET TO LIBERATE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Rebel Roar is a deckbuilder where you must lead an animal revolution against the sinister world order imposed by the Sapiens, an invasive alien race that is on the verge of destroying your planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video