aph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/eeef851e2ce66599594e25d3fbfefe66.poster.avif?t=1787235860\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/eeef851e2ce66599594e25d3fbfefe66.webm?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/eeef851e2ce66599594e25d3fbfefe66.mp4?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">UNLOCK REBELS FOR THE RESISTANCE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Earn Liberation Packs and unlock a wide variety of rebel animals to fight against oppression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/1eb53762ba238ee6975756830685a3cd.poster.avif?t=1787235860\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/1eb53762ba238ee6975756830685a3cd.webm?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/1eb53762ba238ee6975756830685a3cd.mp4?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">SPECIALIZE YOUR REBELS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With every Class Package you earn, you'll discover new classes to assign to your rebels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/fd2fabdb2dc642258ea609389aecfb08.poster.avif?t=1787235860\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/fd2fabdb2dc642258ea609389aecfb08.webm?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/fd2fabdb2dc642258ea609389aecfb08.mp4?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">OVER 500 CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combine your animal cards with class cards and build the perfect deck. With over 500 cards and more than 10 decks to choose from, the possibilities for combos are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/cfe94eee76eb5ed90a76360b6c66aed8.poster.avif?t=1787235860\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/cfe94eee76eb5ed90a76360b6c66aed8.webm?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062700/extras/cfe94eee76eb5ed90a76360b6c66aed8.mp4?t=1787235860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">HUGE CHARACTER ROSTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meet and play as 20 different rebels, each with their own story and unique special card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay m